<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Odin's Statue</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>pray statue
</pre>
<p>A statue of Odin stands behind the altar in the temple of Udgaard, and in 
the Cathedral of Midgaard. Kneel before it and pray, and if you are of 
level 20 or below, Odin's eyes glow and he gives you a gift: the gear a 
beginner needs.
</p>
<ul><li>For everyone: a beer, a torch, some bread, a small wooden shield and a guild medallion.</li>
<li>For your profession: a book of your guild's lore, armour, boots, and a first weapon (a conjurer's robes and dagger, a healer's chainmail and mace, a fighter's plate and axe, a thief's leather and cloak). Only the four starting professions get one.</li>
<li>For those who have finished the newbie quest: a silver ring as well.</li></ul>
<p>You only get what you don't already carry, so pray again whenever you 
have lost your things: when you die, for instance, and need something to 
wear while you go back for your corpse. The gifts are made for beginners, 
not the best in the game, and they are worth nothing in the shops.
</p><p>Above level 20, praying only brings you peace of mind.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Pray</a>
